@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Get Menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu

### Search for item id
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu/6

### Create user
# POST {{baseUrl}}/users
# Content-Type: application/json

# {
#     "name": "John",
#     "email": "john@example.com"
# }

### API with custom headers
# GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/users

# Authorization: Bearer my-secret-token
# Content-Type: application/json
# X-Client-ID: my-fastapi-app